      "CPU precise grouped Q8 computes selected diagonal outputs directly in four temporal-row tiles, preserving four-lane K accumulation and compact borrowed weights.",
      "CPU precise HC4 collapse rounds each product to f32 and performs the original ordered f64 sum without the expanded weighted activation.",
      "A separate CPU batched-group capability preserves decode-only adapters."
    ],
    "benchmark_changes": [
      "At the existing serial warmup/session quiescent boundaries, explicitly release unused glibc pages. This is benchmark-only cleanup, not a production per-token/session allocator policy.",
      "Record pre-release private footprints, allocator live/arena/free bytes before and after release, and cleanup latency.",
      "Charge cleanup latency to every total-session speed comparison. Reject different cleanup protocols or missing costs.",
      "Retain the original 1 MiB RssAnon+VmSwap stability and 1e-5 absolute parity gates; additionally require live-heap stability within 1 MiB. The candidate also passes private-memory stability before cleanup."
    ]
